  "description": "## What changed\n\n### New Features\n- **MovieBox - All-In-One:** Telegram popup on every launch and floating coffee button\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- **MovieBox - All-In-One:** serve downloads as progressive MP4 through the DASH proxy\n\nSigned streams had every URL field rewritten to the DASH manifest, so the downloader fetched index.mpd (a tiny XML) or hit a 403 once cookies were missing — downloads broke while playback kept working. `downloadUrl`, `resourceLink` and `sourceUrl` now receive a local progressive MP4 URL served with cookie handling and Range support, movie titles without se/ep are routed too, and the connection pool gained headroom for parallel download tasks.",
